      "content": "If we accept the premise that these cognitive archetypes are biologically ingrained through these historical pressures, how would this affect the way society should be organized to be most efficient? If certain groups are naturally \"optimized\" for specific types of cognitive tasks—like the instinctive/spatial focus in some or the analytical focus in others—what would be the most logical way to structure global education systems or professional hierarchies to ensure we aren't wasting these inherent biological strengths?",
